# Kept out of broad searches (rg, and Claude Code's search), though saved in git: huge one-line files, test baselines, the
# change log. Search them by naming the file, e.g.  rg -n "pyramid" docs/HISTORY.md
# What git does not save at all (the build, out/) is in .gitignore, which the searches skip too.
game/vendor/
game/data/
tests/baseline/
docs/HISTORY.md
